# Contact form email delivery (Web3Forms, free plan). Create the key at
# https://web3forms.com with the inbox that should receive inquiries — the key
# delivers only to that address. It is public by design (sent from the browser).
# Inlined at build time: redeploy after changing it. Without it the form shows a
# friendly failure message with the public email address instead of sending.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
